# A click on the address field opens a narrow dropdown over the field (CommandBarLayout): 360 pt,
# its input row centred on the field, never the full palette. ⌘T and ⌘L open the palette, centred
# in the window and 766 pt wide (10 Nov 2026).
cra://debug?windowSize=1200x800
wait 2
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=dropdown
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://debug?urlFieldClick=1
wait 0.8
cra://debug?commandBarState=click
expect-log command bar click: open=1 dropdown=1 panel=\d+,\d+,360,\d+ field=
cra://debug?closeCommandBar=1
wait 0.5
cra://action/newTab
wait 0.8
cra://debug?commandBarState=newTab
expect-log command bar newTab: open=1 dropdown=0 panel=\d+,\d+,766,\d+
cra://debug?closeCommandBar=1
wait 0.5
cra://action/editURL
wait 0.8
cra://debug?commandBarState=editURL
expect-log command bar editURL: open=1 dropdown=0 panel=\d+,\d+,766,\d+
cra://debug?closeCommandBar=1
